<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Santa’s Workshop</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">700 snowflakes</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Small RC truck</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.71</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 375px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/72/6_RARES_LEFT%21%21%21.png/revision/latest?cb=20241217234107\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"(from left to right) normal or common colors, rare colors, neon\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/72/6_RARES_LEFT%21%21%21.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/375?cb=20241217234107\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"375\" height=\"86\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"6 RARES LEFT!!!.png\" data-image-key=\"6_RARES_LEFT%21%21%21.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:6_RARES_LEFT!!!.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">(from left to right) normal or common colors, rare colors, neon. </p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>RC Sellner (RC Sellner Explorer) is a small vehicle. As the name suggests, it is a small <a href=\"/wiki/Sellner_Explorer\" title=\"Sellner Explorer\">Sellner Explorer</a>. The player can drive it remotely and it can hold some cargo (e.g. 1 <a href=\"/wiki/Pear\" title=\"Pear\">pear</a>) with some glitches, so drive slowly. It doesn’t have wall at the back side (like the <a href=\"/wiki/Basic_Trailer\" title=\"Basic Trailer\">Basic Trailer</a>), so the cargo can fall off on slopes. However, its maximum speed is 34 studs/s. It can be moved by <a href=\"/wiki/Straight_Conveyor\" title=\"Straight Conveyor\">conveyors</a> or other objects (as it’s an item) and this can be used to create obstacle courses. Like other items in Oaklands, when bought it will change color. It can change into all the colors that normal vehicles can, including rare and neon.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 177px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/70/All_rc_sellners_rare.png/revision/latest?cb=20250903200100\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"all rare rc sellners\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/70/All_rc_sellners_rare.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/177?cb=20250903200100\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"177\" height=\"211\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"All rc sellners rare.png\" data-image-key=\"All_rc_sellners_rare.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:All_rc_sellners_rare.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">all rare rc sellners</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Unfortunately, trailers can not be hitched onto the <b>RC Sellner</b>.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163523\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.035 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 63/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 48/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019467/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   28.097      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   28.097      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3583-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163523 and revision id 19469. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Basic Trailer","exists":true},{"title":"Pear","exists":true},{"title":"Sellner Explorer","exists":true},{"title":"Straight Conveyor","exists":true}],"images":["RCSellner.png","6_RARES_LEFT!!!.png","All_rc_sellners_rare.png"]}
